The person-box encoding, the unbiased warp matrix and the keypoint decoding (DARK refinement and the transform
back to the image) in runtime/image_ops.cpp are adapted from Hugging Face Transformers 5.2.0,
src/transformers/models/vitpose/image_processing_vitpose.py and image_processing_vitpose_fast.py:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/v5.2.0/src/transformers/models/vitpose/image_processing_vitpose.py

