The bilinear sampling of 8-bit pixels (coordinate mapping, spline weights, accumulation order and rounding of
scipy.ndimage.affine_transform with order=1 and mode="constant") and the Gaussian smoothing (kernel, normalization
and the symmetric correlation of scipy.ndimage.gaussian_filter with mode="reflect") in runtime/image_ops.cpp are
adapted from scipy 1.18.1, scipy/ndimage/src/ni_interpolation.c, ni_splines.c, ni_filters.c and
scipy/ndimage/_filters.py: https://github.com/scipy/scipy/tree/v1.18.1/scipy/ndimage

